      "content": "That's a much more robust way to frame it, thank you. It helps them see the structural logic behind the position. To round out their prep, I also want them to look at the counter-arguments. Could you provide a summary of the main critiques against these stricter enforcement positions? My students need to know how opponents usually attempt to deconstruct these points.",
